OL,3,AEvacuees from Russia-occupied city
OL,4,Awhere residents ate weeds arrive in
OL,5,AUkraine
OL,6,
OL,7,FPeople evacuated from the devastated
OL,8,FRussian-occupied city of Oleshky have
OL,9,Fcrossed into the Ukrainian-controlled
OL,10,Fregion of Chernihiv, President
OL,11,FVolodymyr Zelensky has confirmed.
OL,13,FThere were emotional scenes as some of
OL,14,Fthe residents of the frontline city met
OL,15,Frelatives they had not seen for years.
OL,17,FSome elderly residents were so weak
OL,18,Fthat they were carried on stretchers.
OL,19,FThey had been trapped without food,
OL,20,Fwater and electricity, with many
OL,21,Fresorting to cooking garden weeds to
OL,22,Fsurvive.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
