OL,3,AEvacuees from Russia-occupied city
OL,4,Awhere residents ate weeds arrive in
OL,5,AUkraine
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Ukrainian president thanked US
OL,8,FFirst Lady Melania Trump for her
OL,9,Fefforts in brokering a local ceasefire
OL,10,Fthat paved the way for their evacuation
OL,11,Fon Friday.
